<title>PHILIPPINES: Union Bank stock div record date set.</title>
<headline>Union Bank stock div record date set.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Union Bank of the Philippines said on Friday the Securities and Exchange Commission (SEC) has set the record date of its 20 percent stock dividend on November 8, 1996.</p>
<p>The SEC also approved an increase in authorized capital stock of the bank from 3.8 billion pesos to 6.7 billion pesos, Union Bank said in a disclosure.</p>
<p>The par value of the 20 percent stock dividend amounts to 736.10 million pesos, the bank added.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 fax 8176267</p>
